{"parentUuid":"663a932e-97ef-418a-be94-52376e648421","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdbTnsyhKmW83NPMc41gg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SmVfTebknqQ8LmcHqpFbfV","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Map Home tab + summary implementation","subagent_type":"Explore","run_in_background":false,"prompt":"In /home/bilko/Projects/session-manager, find and report on the \"Home\" left-nav tab implementation (renderer) and anything related to generating a project \"Summary\".\n\nReport specifically:\n1. The Home tab component file path(s) and what it renders (sections, widgets).\n2. Any \"generate summary\" button/action — what IPC or function it calls, and where that lands in main process (.cjs).\n3. Whether any summary is persisted to disk today, and where (path). Search for \"summary\" in src/main and src/renderer.\n4. How other features write per-project operations files (e.g. session-manager-operations paths) — the helper used to resolve `<cwd>/session-manager-operations/...` and the atomic write helper.\n5. Existing IPC registration pattern in src/main/index.cjs and ipcSchemas.cjs for a new namespace.\n6. What preload exposes (src/preload*.cjs) so renderer can call new IPC.\n\nBe thorough, give file:line references and short code excerpts. Do not modify anything."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":28045,"cache_read_input_tokens":20848,"output_tokens":480,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":28045,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":480,"cache_read_input_tokens":20848,"cache_creation_input_tokens":28045,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":28045},"type":"mes