{"parentUuid":"aeda12e8-970f-4abc-86c6-1a317ff1248d","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"038a7830-ded0-492d-9af1-4bf1fc941102","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SmVfTebknqQ8LmcHqpFbfV","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Findings below.\n\n## 1. Two distinct \"Home\" surfaces\n\n**A. Left-nav \"Home\" row = `project-home` → ProjectHome (\"The Brief\")**\n- Registered in `/home/bilko/Projects/session-manager/src/renderer/lib/navGroups.ts:29`\n  `{ key: 'project-home', group: 'Workspace', label: 'Home', icon: 'home', hint: 'What this project is, and what is in flight' }`\n- Rendered via `/home/bilko/Projects/session-manager/src/renderer/components/screenComponents.tsx:88-89` (`case 'project-home': return <ProjectHome />`), imported at line 4.\n- Component: `/home/bilko/Projects/session-manager/src/renderer/components/tabs/projecthome/ProjectHome.tsx` (477 lines), primitives in `.../projecthome/ph-primitives.tsx`.\n- Sections (ProjectHome.tsx):\n  - `PhHeader` (:132) — \"The Brief\" kicker, `brief.purpose` headline, **Refresh brief** button, `synthesizedAgoLabel` + model, provenance \"read from\" source chips with drift markers.\n  - `PhNow` (:51) — \"What is in flight\", from `inFlightCards(cwd, snapshots)` (`src/renderer/lib/projectHomeDerive.ts`), live Epic queue.\n  - `PhWhat` (:210) — \"What this is\" paragraphs, pinnable.\n  - `PhAreas` (:230) — \"How it is put together\", area table with heat bars.\n  - `PhScope` (:269) — \"How the goal has moved\".\n  - `PhConventions` (:293) — \"Conventions Claude follows\", pinnable.\n  - `PhOpenQuestions` (:72) — \"Waiting on you\", with \"Answer in Epic →\".\n  - Empty state (:450-472) — \"Generate the brief\" button.\n- Other renderer helpers: `src/renderer/lib/projectBriefView.ts`, `src/renderer/lib/projectHomeDerive.ts`.\n\n**B. `overview` NavKey = machine-wide Home** (reached via the TabBar home chip, not a sidebar row — see navGroups.ts:11-14)\n- `/home/bilko/Proje