{"parentUuid":"43fee588-584b-4367-8874-45657f59c271","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b1b9c97b-80cb-4059-bdfc-a0e31f46cf3e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ep632ThL1GVdSLCZNoGBao","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Findings below. Nothing was modified.\n\n## 1. Scheduler tab structure\n\nThe three tabs do **not** live in `SchedulePanel.tsx` — they live in `/home/bilko/Projects/session-manager/src/renderer/components/tabs/Scheduler.tsx:36-41`:\n\n```\ntype SubView = 'queue' | 'prds' | 'history'\nconst VIEW_OPTIONS = [{key:'queue'},{key:'prds'},{key:'history'}]\n```\nrendered via `SchedulerSubTabs` (`/home/bilko/Projects/session-manager/src/renderer/components/tabs/scheduler/SchedulerSubTabs.tsx:17`), each delegating to:\n- Queue → `SchedulePanel` (`/home/bilko/Projects/session-manager/src/renderer/components/SchedulePanel.tsx`) — **1332 lines**, exports `SchedulePanel` (:92) and `JobRow` (:765); internal sub-view toggle is only `'queue' | 'supervisor'` (:108).\n- PRDs → `/home/bilko/Projects/session-manager/src/renderer/components/tabs/plans/SchedulerPrdsView.tsx` (672 lines, :55)\n- History → `/home/bilko/Projects/session-manager/src/renderer/components/tabs/plans/SchedulerHistoryView.tsx` (262 lines, :28)\n\nAll three accept `scopeCwd` and filter by project cwd.\n\n**JobRow collapsed row cells** (`SchedulePanel.tsx:826-885`), a 4-col grid `[116px_1fr_auto_auto]`:\n1. `<SchBadge status={job.status} />` (:832)\n2. title block: `PrdNumberBadge(prdNumber(job.slug))` + `job.title` (:834-837); `note` line = first line of `job.error` or `verdictLabel(job.verifierVerdict)` (:838-842); **prompt-session chip** (:843-873)\n3. `<ProjectTag cwd={job.cwd} />` (:875)\n4. `trailingLabel` (elapsed / took / ETA) + chevron (:876-885)\n\n**JobRow expanded detail** (`:899-985`), four `DetailBlock`s:\n- Status: `result` (exit code), `state`, `verdict`, `error`\n- Timing: `started`, `finished`, `duration`\n- Location: `group` (`${job.parallelGroup} · ${job.slug}`), `cwd`, `prompt id` = `job.sourcePromptId` (:935), `source tab` = `job.sourceTabId` (:936)\n- Actions: \"view prompt session →\" (only when `linkedPromptSession`), \"view log →\", reset, etc.\n\n**PRD card fields** (`SchedulerPrdsView.tsx:444-489`): `PrdNumberBadge`, `p.title || p.slug`, `PrdStatusPill(prdStatusFor(job))`, then a meta row (`:458-463`) with `ProjectTag cwd={p.cwd}`, `{p.estimateMinutes}m`, `g{p.parallelGroup}`, `edited {formatAgo(p.mtimeMs)}`, then the slug as a button, then needs_review verdict + Re-fire. **No epic/prompt-session field at all.**\n\n**History row** (`SchedulerHistoryView.tsx:174-250`): `SchBadge`, `job.title`, `job.error`, `ProjectTag cwd`, duration/date; expanded → Result (`state`, `verifier`), Timing, Location (`group`, `slug`, `cwd`), Actions. **No epic/prompt-session field.**\n\n## 2. Types\n\n`ScheduleJob` (`/home/bilko/Projects/session-manager/src/preload/api.d.ts:370-418`) carries **no `epicId`**, but does carry:\n- `originSessionId?: string | null` (:406) — the Epic's claudeSessionId\n- `sourceTabId?: string | null` (:410) — \"equals that PromptSession's own id\"\n- `sourcePromptId?: string | null` (:417) — \"the PromptSession (Epic) id this PRD was dispatched from\"\n\n`PrdListItem` (`api.d.ts:451-462`): `slug, parallelGroup, title, cwd, estimateMinutes, mtimeMs, sourcePromptId?` — so the PRDs tab **already receives the epic id** in `sourcePromptId`, it just never renders it.\n\n`useScheduledPrds` (`/home/bilko/Projects/session-manager/src/renderer/lib/useScheduledPrds.ts:16`) returns `PrdListItem[]` verbatim (used by EpicsWorkspace/EpicDetail); `SchedulerPrdsView` does its own `window.api.schedule.listPrds()` (`:73`) into a local `PrdMeta` type (`:15-22`) which drops `sourcePromptId` — that local interface is the only thing hiding it.\n\n## 3. Epic association on disk\n\n- `/home/bilko/Projects/session-manager/src/main/lib/prdLocations.cjs:23` `EPICS_SUBPATH = ['session-manager-operatio